+| --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| `stiffness` | 36.0 | 0.0 to 10000.0 | How strongly each point of the sheet returns to rest. |
+| `damping` | 6.5 | 0.0 to 100.0 | How fast the wobble decays; low values keep the sheet springy. |
+| `coupling` | 100.0 | 0.0 to 10000.0 | Rigidity between neighbouring points; low values make the sheet jelly-like. |
